# Backtest integrity
- Require commission, slippage, sizing, session, currency, fill, and sample-window assumptions.
- Separate in-sample, validation, and out-of-sample periods.
- Prefer parameter stability regions over a single optimum.
- Reject comparisons that change multiple assumptions without disclosure.
- Do not infer robustness from net profit alone.
- Record failure regimes and null results.
